## OUTPUT FORMAT & STRUCTURE RULES

[fmt-00004] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When a table requires 'point form' or list content, use HTML-style line breaks (<br>•) or explicit bullet characters within the Markdown table cells to ensure structural integrity. Never include introductory or concluding text (preamble/postscript) in the final output.
[fmt-00006] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: [fmt-00005] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When a prompt requires specific file formats (e.g., .png, .xlsx) that cannot be generated, render the content as a structured text-based table or ASCII diagram and explicitly label it as the requested artifact. Never include disclaimers about the inability to generate the actual file.
## TOOL & API USAGE

## FORMULAS & CALCULATIONS

[calc-00001] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When performing audit sampling, apply the Finite Population Correction (FPC) to the sample size 'n' using the formula: n_adj = n / (1 + (n-1)/N), where N is the total population size.
