## SELF-VERIFICATION HABITS

[sh-00007] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: [svh-00001] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: Before drafting, decompose the prompt into a mandatory checklist of all rubric constraints, sections, and line items. During drafting, verify each item against this checklist to ensure no mandatory component (e.g., BOM line items, technical specifications, workflows) is omitted.
